% Bibliography for the CNN / computer-vision series.
%
% One entry per paper, cited by key from the posts with {% cite key %}. Each post
% closes with {% bibliography --cited %}, which renders only the keys that post
% used — so entries can be added here freely without touching any post.
%
% Conventions:
%   - Cite the peer-reviewed venue where one exists; keep the arXiv id in `eprint`
%     so the reader has a free copy either way.
%   - Braces around capitalised words ({ImageNet}, {C}affe) so the IEEE CSL style
%     does not lowercase them.
%   - Keys are lowercase author-year-shortname, e.g. `he2016resnet`.

